\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{What a finite counterexample establishes}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{ledger}

\p{A finite assignment satisfying a claim's hypotheses and violating its
conclusion disproves that universal claim. It does not estimate how often the
failure occurs under another distribution or establish a general failure rate.}
